    "body": "FWIW it looks like [drag-and-drop for files](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#drag-and-drop-processing-model:the-drag-data-item-type-string-2) uses `\"application/octet-stream\"` as a default value\r\n\r\nThe only restriction seems to be that [it must be ASCII lowercase](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#the-drag-data-item-type-string), but otherwise is [just refers to the (unhelpful) File spec](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#dom-datatransferitemlist-add)",
